  "limits_en": [
    "A development diagnostic of saved cosine scores for two labels and six queries with known results; no new RNA or replicate experiment.",
    "The 14 reference pairs and 28 decisions recombine the same queries and references; they are not 28 independent experiments.",
    "The primary summary weights the six source queries equally. Pair-weighted results are separately named supplementary summaries.",
    "This tests dependence on median aggregation; it cannot establish compound/group separation, weak response, or mechanism.",
    "The one existing gene-position permutation is retained; no new controls, optimization, or p-values are introduced.",
    "Food/treatment effects, healthy-state restoration and achievable human exposure are untested; the 78-condition protein catalog is unconnected."
